sx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," builds your roadmap in minutes"]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 100,000+ entrepreneurs — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE SCALING ARCHITECT",prompt_text:"Act as a Business Growth Strategist who has helped 100+ freelancers and entrepreneurs scale from $3-5k/month to consistent $10-20k/month profits. Analyze my business situation and build a comprehensive scaling roadmap that I can execute over the next 90 days.\nInclude:\n1. Revenue leak diagnosis — identify the 3 biggest reasons I'm stuck at my current level based on my numbers\n2. Pricing power audit — am I undercharging and how to fix it without losing customers\n3. Customer acquisition math — exact numbers I need to hit for leads, conversions, and LTV to reach $10k/month\n4. Offer stack optimization — how to restructure what I sell to increase average transaction value\n5. Time allocation analysis — where I'm wasting hours on $10/hour tasks instead of $1,000/hour activities\n6. 90-day priority sequence — exact order of moves to make with weekly milestones\n7. Scaling traps to avoid — the 3 mistakes that keep entrepreneurs stuck at $5-7k/month forever",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more powerful mega prompts",prompt_version:"promt-business-growth-strategist-v1"},"indecisive-adult":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," walks you through your decision and delivers"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"clarity fast"})]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," walks you through your decision and delivers"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"clarity fast"})]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 200,000+ major life decisions — this is what actually works right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE DECISION NAVIGATOR",prompt_text:"Act as a seasoned Life Strategy Advisor who has guided 1,000+ people through major crossroads — career pivots, financial choices, relationship decisions, and life transitions — using a structured clarity framework that cuts through overthinking.\nI have a decision I'm struggling with and I need help thinking it through clearly. Walk me through a complete decision-clarity session. Include:\n1. Decision framing — help me articulate what I'm actually deciding in one clear sentence, because I might be conflating multiple decisions,\n2. Priority excavation — ask me questions to surface what I truly care about here, not what I think I should care about,\n3. Fear inventory — help me identify what I'm actually afraid of with each option, because unexamined fears drive bad decisions,\n4. Options mapping — lay out my realistic options with honest pros and cons, including options I might not have considered,\n5. Future self test — help me imagine how I'll feel about each choice in 10 days, 10 months, and 10 years,\n6. Decision pressure test — challenge my current leaning to make sure it holds up under scrutiny,\n7. Overthinking traps to avoid — flag the 3 most common mental patterns that keep people stuck in analysis paralysis and how to break free.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try Prompt #1 and get access to 4 more to stop overthinking and make decisions in minutes.",prompt_version:"prompt-life-strategy-advisor-v1"},"ai-beginner":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["Still getting generic AI responses? This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," reveals"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"what power users do differently"})]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["Still getting generic AI responses? This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," reveals"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"what power users do differently"})]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 400,000+ first-time prompters — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE AI MASTERY BLUEPRINT",prompt_text:"Act as an elite AI Performance Coach who has trained 50,000+ professionals to get 10x better results from AI. I've been using AI for a while but my results are inconsistent — sometimes amazing, usually just okay. I want to finally understand WHY some prompts work and others don't, so I can get exceptional results every time. Include:\n1. The amateur vs. expert gap — analyze what separates people who get \"meh\" responses from those who get incredible ones\n2. The hidden structure — reveal the framework behind every high-performing prompt that I can apply to anything\n3. Advanced techniques — show me 5 methods that intermediate users never discover on their own\n4. My problem patterns — identify the 3 most common mistakes people at my level make and how to fix each one\n5. The conversation strategy — teach me how to build on AI responses to get deeper, more useful results in follow-ups\n6. Context commands — the specific phrases that make AI understand complex requests the first time\n7. My personalized upgrade path — based on how most people use AI, give me a 7-day practice plan to go from intermediate to advanced.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that turn AI beginners into confident prompters.",prompt_version:"prompt-prompting-coach-v1"},latebloomer:{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," turns confusion into"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"clarity"})," ","on any situation in minutes"]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," turns confusion into"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"clarity"})," ","on any situation in minutes"]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 200,000+ adults navigating major life decisions — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE CLARITY GUIDE",prompt_text:"Act as a Thoughtful Decision Coach who has helped thousands of adults think through major life decisions with clarity and confidence. I'm facing a significant decision and I need help organizing my thoughts before I talk to anyone else. Guide me through a structured thinking process that helps me see my situation clearly. Include:\n1. Situation mapping — ask me the right questions to understand what I'm actually dealing with, not just what I think I'm dealing with\n2. Emotion vs. fact separation — help me distinguish between what I'm feeling and what's objectively true about my situation\n3. Stakeholder impact analysis — who else is affected by this decision and how should I factor that in\n4. Option exploration — what are ALL my options, including ones I might not have considered\n5. Consequence mapping — for each option, what are the likely short-term and long-term outcomes\n6. Values alignment check — which options align with who I actually want to be\n7. Decision blockers — what fears or uncertainties are preventing me from thinking clearly, and how can I address each one.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that guide you from confusion to confident action.",prompt_version:"prompt-clarity-guide-v1"},"private-thinker":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," helps you process any situation"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"privately and without judgment"})]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," helps you process any situation"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"privately and without judgment"})]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 150,000+ adults processing difficult life moments — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE PRIVATE THINKING PARTNER",prompt_text:"Act as a Compassionate Thinking Partner who creates a safe, private space for adults to process difficult situations without judgment. I'm going through something significant and I need to talk it through, but I'm not ready to discuss it with anyone in my life yet — not friends, not family, not professionals. Help me process my thoughts in a structured way. Include:\n1. Safe space establishment — remind me that this conversation is private and I can share as much or as little as I want\n2. Gentle exploration — ask me open-ended questions that help me articulate what I'm actually feeling and thinking\n3. Thought untangling — help me separate the different threads of my situation so I can see each piece clearly\n4. Emotional validation — acknowledge what I'm feeling without telling me what I should feel\n5. Perspective offering — help me see my situation from angles I might not have considered\n6. Practical grounding — what are the real, tangible elements of my situation vs. the stories I'm telling myself\n7. Next step clarity — when I'm ready, help me identify the smallest possible next step I could take.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that help you process difficult moments with clarity and care.",prompt_version:"prompt-private-thinking-partner-v1"},investor:{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["Every bad investment has warning signs. This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," ","reveals them"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"before it's too late"})]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["Every bad investment has warning signs. This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," ","reveals them"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"before it's too late"})]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 150,000+ investors analyzing deals — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE DEAL ANALYZER",prompt_text:"Act as a Senior Risk Analyst who has reviewed thousands of investments and saved clients from catastrophic losses. I'm considering an investment and before I commit any capital, I need to understand every possible way this could go wrong. Help me stress-test this opportunity like a professional who gets paid to find problems. Include:\n1. Red flag scan — identify the warning signs that experienced investors look for but beginners miss\n2. Worst-case scenario modeling — show me exactly what happens to my money if things go badly at 3 different levels of severity\n3. Hidden risk audit — reveal the risks that aren't obvious: liquidity traps, hidden fees, lock-up periods, counterparty risks\n4. \"What they're not telling you\" — list the questions I should ask that sellers/promoters hope I don't think of\n5. Historical failure patterns — show me similar investments that went wrong and why, so I can spot the same patterns\n6. Exit strategy stress test — analyze how hard it would be to get my money out if I need to\n7. Go/No-Go verdict — based on risk alone, tell me whether this passes the \"sleep at night\" test and what would need to change for it to be safer.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that help you invest smarter with analyst-level clarity.",prompt_version:"prompt-deal-analyzer-v1"},"real-estate-investor":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," runs pro-level"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"property analysis"})," ","using the world's best LLMs"]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," runs pro-level"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"property analysis"})," ","using the world's best LLMs"]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 75,000+ real estate investors analyzing deals — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE PROPERTY ANALYST",prompt_text:"Act as a Real Estate Investment Analyst who has underwritten thousands of residential and commercial property deals. I'm evaluating a potential investment property and I need to know if the numbers work before I move forward. Analyze this deal with the same rigor a professional underwriter would use. Include:\n1. Cash flow analysis — calculate monthly and annual net operating income based on realistic rent estimates and operating expenses (use the 50% rule as a baseline, then refine)\n2. Cap rate calculation — determine the capitalization rate and compare it to market averages for this property type and location\n3. Cash-on-cash return — calculate my actual return on the cash I'm putting in, including down payment and closing costs\n4. DSCR check — calculate the debt service coverage ratio to see if this property can comfortably cover its mortgage\n5. Break-even occupancy — what occupancy rate do I need to cover all expenses\n6. 5-year projection — model what this investment looks like with realistic rent growth and expense increases\n7. Red flags audit — identify any concerns with this deal that I should investigate further before making an offer.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that help you analyze deals like a seasoned investor.",prompt_version:"prompt-property-analyst-v1"},"first-time-investors":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," teaches investment evaluation using"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"the world's best LLMs"})]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," teaches investment evaluation using"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"the world's best LLMs"})]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 200,000+ first-time investors learning to invest — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE INVESTMENT EDUCATOR",prompt_text:"Act as a Patient Investment Educator who has helped thousands of first-time investors understand how to evaluate opportunities and make smart decisions. I'm new to investing and I want to learn how to think about investment opportunities the right way — not just what to do, but HOW to evaluate any opportunity that comes my way. Teach me the fundamentals. Include:\n1. Investment types explained — break down the main categories (stocks, bonds, real estate, index funds) in plain English with pros and cons of each\n2. The evaluation framework — what are the key questions I should ask about ANY investment before putting money in\n3. Risk vs. reward basics — help me understand how to think about the relationship between potential returns and potential losses\n4. The numbers that matter — what metrics should I look at, and what do they actually tell me (ROI, yield, P/E ratio, cap rate)\n5. Red flags to watch for — what warning signs indicate a bad investment or potential scam\n6. Getting started safely — what's a sensible approach for someone just starting out with limited capital\n7. Common beginner mistakes — what do first-time investors typically get wrong, and how can I avoid those traps.",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that turn investing beginners into confident evaluators.",prompt_version:"prompt-investment-educator-v1"},"introspective-adult":{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," helps you make sense of"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"the signs"})," ","using the world's best LLMs"]}),headline_b:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This AI ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," helps you make sense of"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"the signs"})," ","using the world's best LLMs"]}),authority_line:"Built from aggregate usage patterns of 200,000+ adults processing relationship concerns — this is what's actually working right now.",prompt_name:"AI PROMPT #1/5: THE RELATIONSHIP ANALYZER",prompt_text:"Act as a Thoughtful Relationship Clarity Coach who helps people organize confusing observations and see their situation clearly without judgment. I've noticed some things in my relationship that are bothering me, but I can't tell if I'm seeing a real pattern or if anxiety is making me connect unrelated dots. Help me think through this clearly. Include:\n1. Observation inventory — ask me to list everything I've noticed, no matter how small, so we can see it all in one place\n2. Timeline mapping — help me organize when these things happened to see if there's a pattern over time\n3. Fact vs. interpretation separation — for each observation, help me distinguish between what actually happened vs. the story I'm telling myself about it\n4. Alternative explanation exploration — for each concerning sign, what are other possible explanations besides the worst-case scenario\n5. Pattern assessment — looking at everything together, do these observations suggest a pattern or are they likely unrelated events\n6. Anxiety vs. intuition check — help me understand if my concerns are being amplified by anxiety or if my gut is picking up on something real\n7. Clarity on next steps — based on what we've discussed, what would help me get more clarity (conversation, observation, or something else).",button:"Try This Prompt Now",prompt_info_label:"Review the prompt first. Best results come from using it without edits.",booster_line:"Try this prompt to unlock 4 more that help you see relationship situations with clarity and calm.",prompt_version:"prompt-relationship-coach-v1"}},aE={freelancer:{headline_a:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:["This ",(0,t.jsx)("strong",{children:"prompt"})," creates your freelance personalized"," ",(0,t.jsx)("span",{className:"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-blue-500 to-blue-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent",children:"$10k/month scali